{
  "name": "Page keyword watcher (alert when text appears or disappears)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "f8f06f24-94cb-5751-94bf-c8a6eac3c3eb",
      "name": "Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "raw",
        "jsonOutput": "{\n  \"config\": {\n    \"owner_email\": \"you@example.com\",\n    \"urls\": [\n      \"https://example.com/product\"\n    ],\n    \"keyword\": \"Out of stock\",\n    \"alert_when_found\": false\n  }\n}",
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "7e656b44-3908-576b-a78f-f097e0df1848",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return $('Settings').first().json.config.urls.map((url) => ({ json: { url } }));"
      },
      "id": "1bca64b6-2a97-5463-83ea-f4f2912dd33c",
      "name": "List what to check",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.url }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 20000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true,
              "responseFormat": "text"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "5b52a353-4edc-54c5-983a-3ed3b6b2a6e6",
      "name": "Fetch the page",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const cfg = $('Settings').first().json.config;\nreturn $input.all().map((item, i) => {\n  const $json = item.json;\n  const url = $('List what to check').all()[i].json.url;\n  const body = String($json.body || $json.data || '');\n  const kw = String(cfg.keyword || '').toLowerCase();\n  const found = body.toLowerCase().includes(kw);\n  const problem = cfg.alert_when_found ? found : !found;\n  const detail = found ? 'Found \"' + cfg.keyword + '\" on the page' : 'Did not find \"' + cfg.keyword + '\" on the page';\n  return { json: { url, problem, detail, checked_at: new Date().toISOString() } };\n});"
      },
      "id": "a52dfb37-72fb-5e1d-a0f3-a2f3d76f0179",
      "name": "Judge the result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        960,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "bae15fe8-8091-5726-89a0-9fcde98b3a70",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.problem }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              },
              "rightValue": ""
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "613d03bc-ef33-5824-85ab-aca2e57a9fc1",
      "name": "Problem found?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.config.owner_email }}",
        "subject": "=Page changed: {{ $json.url }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "={{ $json.detail }}\n{{ $json.url }}",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "9cffe4ad-607c-5da1-a0a3-db2ece79e168",
      "name": "Email me the alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1440,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Page keyword watcher (alert when text appears or disappears)\nWatches a page for a phrase. With the defaults it alerts you when the phrase 'In stock' is missing; flip one setting to alert when a phrase appears.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "0fde75d5-d29d-599c-a485-e67488fb3bd1",
      "name": "Note: what this does",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Open **Settings** and list the addresses to check (and your email). Set **keyword** and **alert_when_found** (true = alert when the phrase appears, false = alert when it is missing).\n2. Connect Gmail on **Email me the alert**.\n3. Run it once by hand, look at **Judge the result** to see what it found, then switch to **Active**.\n4. It only emails you when something is wrong, so a quiet inbox means all is well.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "ce73e1db-56c7-5a97-8ead-70e0eba10d4f",
      "name": "Note: setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        400,
        -420
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Schedule": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Settings",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Settings": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "List what to check",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "List what to check": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Fetch the page",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Fetch the page": {
      "main": [
